<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Son of God, who lov’st me,</l><l>I will be Thine alone;</l><l>And all I have and am, Lord,</l><l>Shall henceforth be Thine own!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Reign over me, Lord Jesus;</l><l>Oh, make my heart Thy throne;</l><l>It shall be Thine, dear Savior,</l><l>It shall be Thine alone.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, come and reign, Lord Jesus,</l><l>Rule over everything!</l><l>And keep me always loyal,</l><l>And true to Thee, my King.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
